      <h2>2. MongoDB Database Schema Architecture</h2>
      <p>The system defines collections modeled via Mongoose ODM:</p>

      <div class="schema-box">
        <strong>Collections Architecture:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li><code>users</code>: ObjectId, name, email, role (enum: ['farmer', 'buyer', 'admin']), state, district, phone</li>
          <li><code>crop_listings</code>: farmer (ref: User), cropName, category, quantityKg, expectedPricePerKg, qualityGrade, status</li>
          <li><code>buyer_enquiries</code>: cropListing (ref: CropListing), buyer (ref: User), farmer (ref: User), requestedQuantityKg, offeredPricePerKg, status</li>
          <li><code>government_schemes</code>: name, hindiName, category, purpose, eligibility, benefits, officialUrl</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <pre><code>// Example Mongoose Model Definition in Node.js
const mongoose = require('mongoose');

const CropListingSchema = new mongoose.Schema({
  farmer: { type: mongoose.Schema.Types.ObjectId, ref: 'User', required: true },
  cropName: { type: String, required: true },
  category: { type: String, enum: ['Grains & Cereals', 'Pulses', 'Vegetables', 'Oilseeds'] },
  quantityKg: { type: Number, required: true, min: 1 },
  expectedPricePerKg: { type: Number, required: true },
  harvestDate: { type: Date, default: Date.now },
  status: { type: String, enum: ['Active', 'Under Negotiation', 'Sold'], default: 'Active' },
  createdAt: { type: Date, default: Date.now }
});

module.exports = mongoose.model('CropListing', CropListingSchema);</code></pre>

      <h2>3. Server-Side Routing in Express (Node.js + EJS)</h2>
      <p>How the backend handles both client SPA hydration and server-rendered EJS templates:</p>
      <pre><code>// server.ts
app.set('view engine', 'ejs');
app.set('views', path.join(__dirname, 'views'));

// EJS Server-Side Rendered Route for Mandi Slips
app.get('/trade-receipt/:id', (req, res) => {
  const crop = getCropById(req.params.id);
  res.render('trade_receipt', { crop, buyer, date: new Date().toLocaleDateString() });
});

// JSON RESTful APIs consumed by React SPA
app.post('/api/chat', async (req, res) => {
  const { message } = req.body;
  const reply = await geminiOrAgriculturalEngine(message);
  res.json({ reply });
});</code></pre>

